Subject: [oss-security] [CVE-2018-17202]: Apache Commons Imaging information disclosure
 vulnerability

Severity: Medium

Vendor:
The Apache Software Foundation

Versions Affected:
Apache Sanselan 0.97-incubator

Description:
Certain input files could make the code to enter into an infinite loop when=
 Apache Sanselan=C2=A0 0.97-incubator was used to parse them, which could b=
e used in a DoS attack. Note that Apache Sanselan (incubating) was renamed =
to Apache Commons Imaging.

Mitigation:
0.97-incubator users should upgrade to commons-imaging-1.0-alpha1

Credit:
This issue was discovered by =EF=BB=BFGuido Vranken.

